clCreateBuffer:
===============
CPU Side allocations
---------------------
USE_HOST_PTR      : Supply CL runtime with your own memory. Generally if its below a certain size limit its all copied into a prepinned buffer pool. Else its pinned and DMA'ed to the GPU
ALLOCATE_HOST_PTR : Let the System give you pre-pinned buffers for the DMA
GPU Side allocations
---------------------
Default           : No options, this is for Device (GPU) memory allocation
